{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological FMV game where dialogue is combat, nine personas fight to survive, and every choice drives you toward a radically different ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Essentially this is a nervous breakdown simulator wearing a cheap suit.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every conversation is a weapon. Every win exposes another piece of Clive\u2019s disturbing past. Lose, and a persona is wiped out for good.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4K live action</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical dialogue battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One actor playing every fractured self</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016950/extras/2721303ceedf759dfde947e9577273dc.avif?t=1769085765\" width=1234 height=644 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Clive hosts the show. He wants you to lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you like your games unsettling, stylish, and unforgettable, hit <strong>Wishlist</strong> now.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Clive is waiting...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Featuring NEIL BELL</strong><br>(Star Wars: Andor, Dune, Peaky Blinders, Adolescence) as every persona (and Clive) - a one-man psychological demolition job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Original score by SANO DG</strong><br>(Tekken, Drakengard, Ridge Racer) driving the chaos with a cold, hypnotic pulse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src